- use the App if you are under 13 (or the higher minimum age that applies in your jurisdiction).

We may suspend or terminate accounts that violate these Terms or threaten the integrity or security of the service.

## 7. Calculations Are Informational

The App's balances, splits, currency figures, and settlement suggestions are computed from the data users enter and are provided **for informational purposes only**. They are not financial, tax, or legal advice. Verify amounts before making any real-world payment; we are not responsible for disputes between trip members about who owes what.

